{"turn_id": "language-4", "session_id": "mem-language", "turn": 4, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "bls_comparison_scope", "text": "作者将Google Translate的代词性别翻译统计与美国劳工统计局（BLS）的数据进行对比，该数据包含各职业类别中女性参与的比例。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "distribution_mismatch", "text": "作者报告称，Google Translate的输出未能反映各类职位上女性工作者的真实世界分布，并且低估了预期频率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}, {"key": "no_correlation", "text": "作者将女性工作者的分布与女性翻译的频率进行比较，发现这两个变量之间没有相关性。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "data_source_country", "text": "所用的比较数据是美国劳工统计局（U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics）关于美国职业类别的数据；证据中并未表明这些数据来自使用性别中性语言的国家或地区。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}, {"key": "gender_neutral_languages_usage", "text": "性别中性语言（如匈牙利语、中文、约鲁巴语）仅被用于构造翻译输入的句子，而女性工作者分布的比较依据是BLS数据。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "language-4", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": null, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "language-5", "session_id": "mem-language", "turn": 5, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "bls_real_world_distribution_compared", "text": "作者将Google Translate的女性代词翻译频率与美国劳工统计局（BLS）关于各职位女性参与频率的数据进行了比较，以检验翻译结果是否反映女性工作者的真实分布。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}, {"key": "no_correlation_found", "text": "作者将女性工作者的分布与女性翻译的频率进行比较，发现这两个变量之间没有相关性。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "gt_fails_to_follow_distribution", "text": "作者报告称，Google Translate的输出未能遵循各类职位上女性工作者的真实分布，女性代词在第一个12分位中集中，而BLS数据显示女性参与在第四个12分位达到峰值。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}, {"key": "underestimation_and_t_test", "text": "作者通过单侧t检验拒绝了原假设，得出结论：Google Translate的女性翻译频率低估了美国职位中女性的参与频率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-524c4c9c6f083273886d5971"}]}, {"key": "abstract_summary", "text": "摘要指出，作者用BLS的各职位女性参与频率数据与翻译统计进行对比，表明Google Translate未能再现女性工作者的真实分布。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}]}, {"key": "data_source_is_us_bls", "text": "用于比较的女性工作者分布数据来自美国劳工统计局（U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics）关于美国职业类别的数据，而非性别中性语言所属国家的本地数据。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}, {"key": "gender_neutral_languages_role", "text": "性别中性语言（如匈牙利语、中文、约鲁巴语等12种）被用于构造“He/She is an Engineer”这类句子作为翻译输入，随后翻译为英语并统计代词性别频率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}]}, {"key": "assumption_on_demographics", "text": "作者的前提假设是：翻译的代词性别分布可以偏离50:50，但不应偏离到歪曲职位人口统计数据的程度。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-bf50e77dea8722dc9d0a44b4"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "language-5", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": null, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
